# Internal engineering artifacts — NOT generated output, and not discarded.
# Dispatcher state, task charters, debug reports, blind verification sets and raw
# diagnostic dumps. This repository is PUBLIC and ships a distributable Obsidian
# plugin; those artifacts carry local filesystem paths and are not part of the
# product. They live in their own PRIVATE repository, checked out in place at
# workflowArtifacts/ as a nested git repo, with the full 305-commit history carried
# over by `git subtree split`.
/workflowArtifacts/

# Generated test and E2E output
